<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>ระบบยืม-คืนอุปกรณ์</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/bootstrap.min.css">
    <style>
        html, body {
            height: 100%;
            margin: 0;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6a11cb 0%, #2575fc 100%);
        }

        /* Hero Section as Centered Card */
        .hero-container {
            height: 100vh; /* เต็มหน้าจอ */
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .hero-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            padding: 50px 40px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 600px;
            width: 100%;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }

        .hero-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }

        .hero-card h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #6a11cb, #2575fc);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        .hero-card p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: #555;
            margin-bottom: 35px;
        }

        .btn-group-custom {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .btn-custom {
            min-width: 150px;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            border-radius: 10px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .btn-login {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #6a11cb, #2575fc);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(42, 102, 255, 0.4);
        }

        .btn-login:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #2575fc, #6a11cb);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(42, 102, 255, 0.5);
        }

        .btn-register {
            background-color: transparent;
            color: #6a11cb;
            border: 2px solid #6a11cb;
        }

        .btn-register:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #6a11cb, #2575fc);
            color: white;
            border-color: transparent;
        }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 576px) {
            .hero-card {
                padding: 40px 20px;
            }
            .btn-group-custom {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 10px;
            }
            .btn-custom {
                min-width: 100%;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="hero-container">
        <div class="hero-card">
            <h1>ระบบยืม-คืนอุปกรณ์ในบริษัท</h1>
            <p>จัดการอุปกรณ์ของบริษัทได้อย่างสะดวก รวดเร็ว และเป็นระเบียบ</p>
            <div class="btn-group-custom">
                <a href="/login" class="btn btn-custom btn-login">เข้าสู่ระบบ</a>
                <a href="/register" class="btn btn-custom btn-register">สมัครสมาชิก</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
